  "prefLabel": "Pes 301.03 Minimum risk pesticides",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 301.03 “Minimum risk pesticides” means the active ingredients contained in pesticide products exempt from federal registration under Section 25(b) of the Federal Insecticide, Fungicide, and Rodenticide Act (FIFRA).\n\nSource. #12756, eff 4-10-19; ss by #13363, eff 6-1-22, EXPIRES: 6-1-32",
